  IconPath: icons/weapons/staves/staff-nature.webp
  Description: "Usage a staff, bo staff, fighting stick, khakkara, or any weapon
    in the spear or polearm weapon group This humble stick-like weapon has an elegant
    simplicity to it, affording you reliable strikes over flashy maneuvers. Immanence
    The noble branch deals 2 additional spirit damage per weapon damage die to creatures
    it Strikes. Transcendence\u2014 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Strike,
    Breathe, Rend] 1 (spirit, transcendence) @Embed[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.oaJeGdGPmHiNT5mP
    inline]"
